- `\p{Cyrillic}` is the Unicode script class. It's broader: it includes Ukrainian, Kazakh, Kyrgyz and other letters (`і`, `ң`, `ө`), which is often what you actually want;
- compile once at package level (`MustCompile`), not per call;
- RE2 guarantees linear time (no catastrophic backtracking) but has no backreferences or lookarounds;
